    { apply K38; [right; clear; lia| clear - EXT_S STKZ SPL E1 E2 E3; subst STK p; lia| clear - ZSB STKZ SPL SB0; subst STK Sh; lia| clear - ZTS STKZ SPL; subst STK; lia
